      "value": "@{5ac57845180a7e323c02d48d|full_name}: It is still happening. Usually I can tell that I've been logged out because it also fails to update my friends list in-game. I check friends list in browser. It might have logged me out there. I log back in and see that the friends list there doesn't match the friends list in the game. I fear that invites and invite requests might not come through either. After I restart the game I am requested to log in again.",
